   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 32,
   "version": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "一套机制 ★：MutationTracker（interceptor）+ Checkpointer，挂在服务工具调用的那条 pipeline 上",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "一套机制 ★：MutationTracker（interceptor）+ Checkpointer，挂在服务工具调用的那条 pipeline 上",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "boundElements": [],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "asym-b",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 994.5,
   "width": 697.9,
   "height": 90.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8e8e8",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 33,
   "version": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "tracker 判断这步改没改（view/grep 不算），Checkpointer 每个 exec 调用后跑一次：\n  改了 → 拍新快照；没改 → map 指向上一张（不花钱，map 依然完整）；层链压缩 → re-board；128 层 → squash\n两条 transport 只差「谁构造」和「记录落哪」。之前是两套散装 mixin，两边各错一半：\n  http 的 tracker 没挂上 pipeline、没人喂 → 不开 always 时每一步都被判「clean」，agent 写了文件 map 却说没变\n  stdio 手写捕获 → view 白拍一张、grep 那步没有 map 条目、也没有层链维护\n真机验证（不开 always）：write→拍、view→clean 复用、write→再拍，两条 transport 逐条一致。",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "tracker 判断这步改没改（view/grep 不算），Checkpointer 每个 exec 调用后跑一次：\n  改了 → 拍新快照；没改 → map 指向上一张（不花钱，map 依然完整）；层链压缩 → re-board；128 层 → squash\n两条 transport 只差「谁构造」和「记录落哪」。之前是两套散装 mixin，两边各错一半：\n  http 的 tracker 没挂上 pipeline、没人喂 → 不开 always 时每一步都被判「clean」，agent 写了文件 map 却说没变\n  stdio 手写捕获 → view 白拍一张、grep 那步没有 map 条目、也没有层链维护\n真机验证（不开 always）：write→拍、view→clean 复用、write→再拍，两条 transport 逐条一致。",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "boundElements": [],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "autoResize": true
  },
